  "function_revised": "NTF2-like / SnoaL-like superfamily protein (cone-shaped alpha+beta fold). HHpred converges (25/25) on NTF2-like-fold proteins at high confidence (top YbjP lipoprotein 98.2% E8.1e-6; NTF2-like transpeptidase, anti-sigma-I RsgI sensor, Rieske-dioxygenase beta subunits, scytalone dehydratase, SnoaL-like polyketide cyclase, the characterised M.tb NTF2-like protein Rv3472). This is a functionally diverse superfamily (polyketide cyclase, ketosteroid isomerase, scytalone dehydratase, dioxygenase beta-subunit, anti-sigma sensor); the precise function is undetermined. The top hit (lipoprotein) and an N-terminal hydrophobic region suggest a possible membrane-anchored / secreted NTF2-like protein. RefSeq leaves this locus uncharacterised.",
